WEBVTT

00:04:57.406 --> 00:05:01.389
and we feel gratitude.

00:05:01.413 --> 00:05:05.020
We forget about all of our new
middle-class frustrations

00:05:05.044 --> 00:05:06.895
and disappointments,

00:05:06.919 --> 00:05:09.579
and we feel like millionaires.

00:05:09.603 --> 00:05:10.729
Thank you.

00:05:10.753 --> 00:05:14.746
(Applause)